<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any claim or dispute referred to in paragraph 4(1)(a), (b), (c) or (v) may be commenced in the High Court as an action in rem against the related ship or property."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "An action in rem may be commenced against a ship, aircraft or property in the High Court if there is a maritime lien or other charge on the ship, aircraft or property for the amount claimed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3__para_b> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "If any claim or dispute referred to in the paragraphs 4(1)(e), (f), (h), (j) to (o) and (q) to (u) arises in connection with a ship and the person who would be liable on the claim in an action in personam was, when the cause of action arose, the owner, charterer, in possession of or in control of the ship, an action in rem may, regardless of whether or not the claim gives rise to a maritime lien on the ship, be commenced against—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "a" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3__para_a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "that ship, if at the time when the action is brought, such person is either the beneficial owner of that ship and all the shares in the ship or the charterer of the ship under a bareboat charterparty agreement; or"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
