<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_3__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "any of his other ship, if at the time when the action is brought, such person is either the beneficial owner of that ship and all the shares in the ship or the charterer of the ship under a bareboat charterparty agreement."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4__para_n> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purpose of the claim under paragraphs 4(1)(m) and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4__para_n> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4__para_n> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "n" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4__para_n> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_4__para_n> <https://schema.org/text> "in respect of an aircraft, an action in rem may be brought in the High Court against the aircraft if at the time the action is brought, the aircraft is beneficially owned by the person who would be liable on the claim in an action in personam."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "If any claim referred to in paragraph 4(1)(m) or (n) arises in connection with an aircraft and the person who would be liable on the claim in an action in personam was, when the cause of action arose, the beneficial owner of the aircraft, an action in rem may be commenced against the aircraft."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "6" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "In determining whether a person would be liable on a claim in an action in personam under subsections (3) and (4), the person shall be presumed to have his habitual residence or a place of business within Malaysia."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "7" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "If a ship or property has been sold under this Act, any action in rem that could have been brought against the ship or property may be brought against the proceeds of the sale of the ship or property provided that the proceeds remains held by the High Court."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "8" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_7__subsec_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Any service of a warrant of arrest in an action in rem against a ship under paragraphs 4(1)(e), (f), (h), (j) to (o) and (q) to (u) shall preclude the service of a warrant of arrest against any other ship for the same claim without affecting the right of the claimant to initially issue a writ naming multiple ships or issue multiple writs each naming a different ship. Action for wages"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "8" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@/~part_III__cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Nothing in this Act shall be construed as limiting the jurisdiction of the High Court to refuse to hear an action for wages commenced by a seafarer or his heir, where the action concerns a ship other than a Malaysian ship."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2026/17/eng@> .
